  "id": "gender-identity-disorder",
  "term": "gender identity disorder",
  "definition": "Gender identity disorder is a term used for people whose assigned biological sex is experienced as not matching their gender identity, when this incongruence is not due to a physical intersex condition. In the source packet, the term is applied to transsexual individuals.",
